---
title: Pasta arrabbiata
servings: 4
tags: [pasta, weeknight, vegetarian]
---

Bring a large pot of water to the boil, salt it with @salt and cook @spaghetti{400%g} until al dente.

Meanwhile, finely chop @onion{1} and @garlic{3%cloves}. Gently fry them in @olive oil{3%tbsp} with @chili flakes{=1%tsp} for ~{5%minutes}.

Add @passata{500%g}, season with @&salt and simmer for ~{15%minutes}. Toss with the pasta.

Serve with @?parmesan{60%g} and @basil{a handful}.
